'''Barbarian Guard''' is an [[Mob]] that patrols {{zone|Dragontail}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Barbarian Guards''' can be found patrolling {{Zone|Dragontail}} on the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Behavior ==
If a player has -1000 or lower {{Reputation|barbarian}}, or if the player attacks the guard at least three times, the player will be attacked. When hostile, the '''Barbarian Guard''' has {{stat|hp|50,000,000}} and deals {{stat|dmg|20,000}}.

Once a player has been targeted, the guards will chase all the way even into the upstairs of a building. {{PotN|Slowness}} splash potions can drastically obstruct their movement, useful when the player has difficulty on accessing merchant NPCs.

