'''Spaceman''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears in {{zone|The Garden}}. They have a {{Chance|0.0439%|1|2277.67}} chance to appear after the player has reached {{Skill|Garden|15}} and has served {{Green|75}} unique [[Garden Visitors]].

Every {{Green|3,000th}} visitor on {{Zone|The Garden}} is guaranteed to be '''Spaceman''', assuming the player otherwise meets the requirements.

== Mechanics ==
'''Spaceman''' asks for a random crop, with the amount of items they want being as close to {{c|1b}} [[NPC]] sell price as possible in the highest tier compacted form of the crop.

Accepting guarantees {{Skill XP|100,000 Farming}}, {{DarkGreen|75 Garden XP}}, {{Copper|100}} and a {{Item|Space Helmet}} as a reward. If '''Spaceman''' was [[Carrot-Colored Vinyl Set|{{Pink|charmed}}]] during their previous visit, their next visit also rewards an {{Item|Astronaut Minion Skin}}.

